validating lr 1 parsers|2012"}]},{"relation":"cites-key","args":[{"t":"entry","v":"firsovCertifiedNormalizationContextFree2015"},{"t":"int","v":7},{"t":"str","v":"doi:10.1007/978-3-642-04652-0_5"}]},{"relation":"cites-key","args":[{"t":"entry","v":"firsovCertifiedNormalizationContextFree2015"},{"t":"int","v":7},{"t":"str","v":"title:dependently typed programming in agda|2009"}]},{"relation":"cites-key","args":[{"t":"entry","v":"firsovCertifiedNormalizationContextFree2015"},{"t":"int","v":8},{"t":"str","v":"doi:10.1007/978-3-642-25379-9_10"}]},{"relation":"cites-key","args":[{"t":"entry","v":"firsovCertifiedNormalizationContextFree2015"},{"t":"int","v":8},{"t":"str","v":"title:simple functional sound and complete parsing for all context free grammars|2011"}]},{"relation":"cites-key","args":[{"t":"entry","v":"firsovCertifiedNormalizationContextFree2015"},{"t":"int","v":9},{"t":"str","v":"title:an agda proof of the correctness of valiants algorithm for context free parsing sjoblom masters thesis chalmers|2013"}]},{"relation":"cites-key","args":[{"t":"entry","v":"firsovCertifiedNormalizationContextFree2015"},{"t":"int","v":10},{"t":"str","v":"doi:10.1007/978-3-540-74591-4_14"}]},{"relation":"cites-key","args":[{"t":"entry","v":"firsovCertifiedNormalizationContextFree2015"},{"t":"int","v":10},{"t":"str","v":"title:verified decision procedures on context free grammars|2007"}]},{"relation":"cites-listed","args":[{"t":"entry","v":"firsovCertifiedNormalizationContextFree2015"},{"t":"str","v":""}]},{"relation":"entry","args":[{"t":"entry","v":"firsovCertifiedNormalizationContextFree2015"}]},{"relation":"import","args":[{"t":"entry","v":"firsovCertifiedNormalizationContextFree2015"},{"t":"entry","v":"reference-kind"},{"t":"str","v":"reference"}]},{"relation":"kind","args":[{"t":"entry","v":"firsovCertifiedNormalizationContextFree2015"},{"t":"str","v":"reference"}]},{"relation":"meta","args":[{"t":"entry","v":"firsovCertifiedNormalizationContextFree2015"},{"t":"str","v":"bibtex"},{"t":"str","v":"@inproceedings{firsovCertifiedNormalizationContextFree2015,\n title = {Certified {Normalization} of {Context}-{Free} {Grammars}},\n author = {Firsov, Denis and Uustalu, Tarmo},\n year = {2015},\n isbn = {978-1-4503-3296-5},\n doi = {10.1145/2676724.2693177},\n url = {https://dl.acm.org/doi/10.1145/2676724.2693177},\n urldate = {2024-05-13},\n booktitle = {Proceedings of the 2015 {Conference} on {Certified} {Programs} and {Proofs}},\n pages = {167--174},\n publisher = {ACM},\n address = {Mumbai India},\n month = {January},\n language = {en},\n abstract = {Every context-free grammar can be transformed into an equivalent one in the Chomsky normal form by a sequence of four transformations. In this work on formalization of language theory, we prove formally in the Agda dependently typed programming language that each of these transformations is correct in the sense of making progress toward normality and preserving the language of the given grammar. Also, we show that the right sequence of these transformations leads to a grammar in the Chomsky normal form (since each next transformation preserves the normality properties established by the previous ones) that accepts the same language as the given grammar. As we work in a constructive setting, soundness and completeness proofs are functions converting between parse trees in the normalized and original grammars.}\n}"}]},{"relation":"meta","args":[{"t":"entry","v":"firsovCertifiedNormalizationContextFree2015"},{"t":"str","v":"container"},{"t":"str","v":"Proceedings of the 2015 Conference on Certified Programs and Proofs"}]},{"relation":"meta","args":[{"t":"entry","v":"firsovCertifiedNormalizationContextFree2015"},{"t":"str","v":"doi"},{"t":"str","v":"10.1145/2676724.2693177"}]},{"relation":"meta","args":[{"t":"entry","v":"firsovCertifiedNormalizationContextFree2015"},{"t":"str","v":"entry-type"},{"t":"str","v":"inproceedings"}]},{"relation":"meta","args":[{"t":"entry","v":"firsovCertifiedNormalizationC